Answer #5

  01. The Knight lives in the first house.
  02. The Knight lives next to the blue house.
  03. The Knight lives next to the second house.
  04. The second house therefore is blue.
  05. The owner of the third house drinks milk.
  06. The green house is to the left of the white house.
  07. The owner of the green house drinks coffee.
  08. The green house therefore is the fourth house.
  09. The white house therefore is the fifth house.
  10. The Prophet lives in the red house.
  11. The Prophet therefore lives in the middle house.
  12. The Knight's house therefore is yellow.
  13. The owner of the yellow house (the Knight) smokes Dunhill.
  14. The man who keeps horses lives next to the man who smokes Dunhill.
  15. The man who keeps horses therefore lives in the second house.
  16. The man who smokes Blends has a neighbor who drinks water.
  17. The neighbor who drinks water must therefore be the Knight 
      (in the first house).
  18. The man who smokes Blends must therefore live in the second house.
  19. The owner of the second house therefore cannot drink beer.
  20. The owner of the fifth house must therefore drink beer 
      (and smoke Blue Master).
  21. The owner of the second house must therefore drink tea 
      (and be the Chef).
  22. The Dark must therefore live in the fourth house (and smoke Prince).
  23. The Druid must therefore live in the fifth house (and keep dogs).
  24. The Prophet must therefore smoke Pall Mall (and keep birds).
  25. The man who smokes Blends has a neighbor who keeps cats.
  26. The Knight must therefore keep cats.
  27. THE DARK MUST THEREFORE KEEP FISH.

